str Example code :

print("Hello" + " " + "World") # concatenation (Hello World)
print("Hello" * 3) # repetition (HelloHelloHello)
print("Hello" , "World") # multiple arguments (Hello World)
print("Hello" + str(5)) # concatenation with int (Hello5)
print(f"Hello {5}") # f-string (Hello 5)

